From e6772d37d74372bcb17b645cc227185feb2af9ac Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: PocketForge Maintainers <maintainers@pocketforge.invalid>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 19:02:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 35/50] hw/display: own A133 display register pipeline

Replace the display and IOMMU RAM stubs with a clean-room device that
owns the real apertures. Complete the hardware-owned probe and transfer
bits and implement the sun50i two-level IOVA walk required by DE2 scanout.

Rebase resolutions:
- Display Meson/QOM: place the native display model in the v11 source set and use const class-init data.

Assisted-by: LLM

